WEBVTT

00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:07.480
<i>If rain pours from
the sky, it's no big deal.</i>

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:11.280
<i>If spears pour from
the sky, it's no big deal.</i>

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:16.530
<i>No matter what happens, it's no big deal.</i>

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:22.790
Eila-san! Not using a shield is dangerous.

00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:25.710
Huh? Haven't you been watching?

00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:26.630
Huh?

00:00:31.050 --> 00:00:32.220
And there you have it.

00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:37.510
In-Incredible!

00:02:09.230 --> 00:02:10.360
That's all of them?

00:02:10.360 --> 00:02:12.570
Looks like we shot
most of them down.

00:02:12.570 --> 00:02:14.480
But this is odd. There's no response.

00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:16.780
They're all drones.

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:19.490
We're looking for the one in command.

00:02:19.490 --> 00:02:20.990
So it's still fully operational?

00:02:20.990 --> 00:02:23.490
Sure we didn't shoot it
down at some point?

00:02:23.490 --> 00:02:26.120
Once the Neuroi controlling them is gone, they should vanish.

00:02:31.210 --> 00:02:32.750
What is that thing?

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:34.960
It goes right up through the clouds.

00:02:34.960 --> 00:02:36.170
Wow...

00:02:36.510 --> 00:02:38.630
Could that be the one controlling them?

00:02:38.630 --> 00:02:40.340
You guys, wait here.

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:41.720
Major!

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:51.400
Such high altitude...

00:02:53.060 --> 00:02:54.070
Is that the core?

00:02:58.110 --> 00:02:59.610
I guess I can't go any higher.

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:08.080
This is going to be a pain.

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:12.130
We're retreating. Return to base.

00:03:12.130 --> 00:03:13.920
But the enemy is still...

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:15.670
We'll adjust our plan back at base.

00:03:15.670 --> 00:03:17.840
We've been out too long today.

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:21.340
We won't make it back to
base if we don't leave soon.

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:39.150
What is that?

00:03:39.150 --> 00:03:40.190
What's the big idea?

00:03:40.190 --> 00:03:42.030
Is it some sort of branch?

00:03:42.030 --> 00:03:44.280
Leave me alone. It's nothing.

00:03:44.280 --> 00:03:46.080
Where did you find it?

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:48.330
Why do you have it?

00:03:48.330 --> 00:03:50.460
What difference does it make?

00:03:50.460 --> 00:03:53.880
Would it kill you to
just show it to me?

00:03:56.210 --> 00:04:00.300
How can you move
so quickly, Eila-san?

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:04.300
It's not just quickness
that lets me move like this.

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:07.600
I have magic that lets
me see into the future.

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:13.480
Whether it's you or the enemy, I know exactly what the next move will be.

00:04:14.980 --> 00:04:16.900
Have you been paying any attention?

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:21.240
I don't like to brag, but I've never used a shield during battle.

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:25.780
People dependent on them are second-tier to me.

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:26.820
That's not fair!

00:04:27.450 --> 00:04:31.040
People say I'm only
good for my shield!

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:34.040
Don't be so mean to her, Eila.

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:34.920
Hmm?

00:04:37.590 --> 00:04:39.050
Welcome back, everyone.

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:40.340
Sanya.

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:41.590
Sanya-chan.

00:04:45.470 --> 00:04:48.890
Oh, so you're on night patrol.

00:04:48.890 --> 00:04:50.060
Yes.

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:53.270
Hold on, Sanya. You're
relieved of tonight's duties.

00:04:53.270 --> 00:04:54.850
Head back to base with the rest.

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:57.020
Yes, ma'am.

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:06.490
We received a communique
from mission control.

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:08.830
About the Neuroi we faced today?

00:05:08.830 --> 00:05:09.910
Yes.

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:13.960
We're taking over for the
Romagna Air Force and Navy.

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:15.120
Oh?

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:17.960
I'm sure they're looking for results.

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:21.960
Shall we show them
what we're capable of?

00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:32.890
Carrying this big thing around all the time must be really difficult, huh, Sanya-chan?

00:05:33.560 --> 00:05:36.020
Not really. I'm used to it.

00:05:36.020 --> 00:05:39.360
Sanya has night patrol by herself a lot.

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:44.190
She uses the Fliegerhammer here when she has to fight.

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:46.700
Wow, that's amazing.

00:05:48.030 --> 00:05:52.580
But I bet it's less lonely
with someone else, right?

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:54.000
Yeah.

00:05:54.910 --> 00:05:56.620
Oh, right.

00:05:57.290 --> 00:05:58.170
Here...

00:05:58.170 --> 00:05:59.710
Oh, that...

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:02.130
Is that a conifer twig?

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:03.750
Take this, Sanya.

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:05.720
But it's just a twig.

00:06:05.720 --> 00:06:06.760
Oh...

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:09.340
Thank you, Eila.

00:06:10.090 --> 00:06:13.930
Where we were flying today,
there's a cypress forest just ahead.

00:06:14.270 --> 00:06:17.730
It kind of looked the way
Orussia does in the winter.

00:06:17.730 --> 00:06:21.770
There were a bunch of those trees where I used to live.

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:23.190
Yeah?

00:06:23.190 --> 00:06:24.780
Really?

00:06:29.240 --> 00:06:31.570
Air force spy planes
took these photographs.

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:34.080
It just looks like a bunch of noise.

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:37.200
This is the Neuroi we
spotted this afternoon.

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:39.460
This is what happened when they
tried to photograph the whole thing.

00:06:40.290 --> 00:06:42.920
Estimates put it at over thirty thousand meters long.

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:44.050
Thirty thousand?!

00:06:44.050 --> 00:06:46.300
So it reaches an altitude of thirty kilometers?

00:06:46.300 --> 00:06:48.840
Um, so compared to Mt. Fuji, it's...

00:06:50.130 --> 00:06:54.890
It's slowly cruising toward Rome,
at a rate of 10 kilometers per hour.

00:06:55.930 --> 00:06:58.520
The difficult part is about its core's location.

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:00.310
Here.

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:01.480
The very top?

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:04.150
Yes. I verified it myself.

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:09.650
But our Striker Units top out at ten thousand meters.

00:07:09.650 --> 00:07:12.910
Right. So for this mission, we'll need to use this.

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:15.410
A rocket booster.

00:07:15.990 --> 00:07:19.210
Then we'll be able to fly up to the core?

00:07:19.210 --> 00:07:22.710
No, I don't think it'll be that simple.

00:07:22.710 --> 00:07:23.460
Right.

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:28.050
The booster is quite powerful, but it
consumes magic power at a very high rate.

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:29.970
We'll only be able to fly for a short while.

00:07:30.340 --> 00:07:34.220
Then we should carry
someone part of the way up.

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:35.180
Precisely.

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:39.680
But thirty thousand meters up, there won't be any air.

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:41.690
What? No air?

00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:44.150
Then we won't be able to talk, either.

00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:45.610
Oh, that's probably true.

00:07:45.610 --> 00:07:47.360
What?! No sound?

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:53.240
Thirty thousand meters is unknown territory, well beyond the highest altitude record.

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:57.410
But we're Witches. There is nothing Witches cannot do.

00:07:58.370 --> 00:08:03.870
So the one best equipped for
extensive and momentary combat is...

00:08:05.380 --> 00:08:09.130
Sanya. I'd like you to attack the core.

00:08:09.130 --> 00:08:09.840
Huh?

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:14.640
Your Fliegerhammer is
critical to this operation.

00:08:14.640 --> 00:08:17.140
Excuse me! I'd like to go with her, then.

00:08:17.140 --> 00:08:18.850
Oh, right.

00:08:18.850 --> 00:08:22.140
Eila, have you ever used
a shield, by any chance?

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:23.600
A shield?

00:08:24.150 --> 00:08:28.690
I don't mean to brag, but I've never once used a shield in combat.

00:08:28.690 --> 00:08:29.610
Then you can't go.

00:08:29.610 --> 00:08:30.940
Yeah, exactly.

00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:32.030
What?

00:08:32.030 --> 00:08:33.950
Yeah, that's not going to do.

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:34.990
Wh-Why not?

00:08:35.530 --> 00:08:37.030
Besides using the booster,

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:41.080
this mission will demand survival ability in extreme conditions,

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:45.330
as well as skills for dealing with high levels of magic power consumption.

00:08:45.330 --> 00:08:49.250
In other words, Sanya will not be able
to put any focus on protecting herself.

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:53.970
We'll need one other person to protect Sanya up there.

00:08:53.970 --> 00:08:57.970
I-It's not like I'm <i>not</i> able to use a shield!

00:08:57.970 --> 00:09:00.100
But you've never done it in combat.

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:01.430
That's right.

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:03.020
That won't cut it.

00:09:05.690 --> 00:09:07.150
Miyafuji, you go.

00:09:07.150 --> 00:09:08.360
Y-Yes, ma'am.

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:09.230
What?

00:09:09.230 --> 00:09:12.900
You're able to deploy
very strong shields.

00:09:13.650 --> 00:09:15.150
R-Right...

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:16.320
Huh?

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:27.170
E-Excuse me, do you think you could give me some space?

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:29.500
What do you want me to do?
It's cramped in here.

00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:33.670
Why on earth was I asked to come here?

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:36.720
It's because you're
always berating Miyafuji.

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:39.140
They say your enemy's
enemy is your friend, right?

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:42.010
Just what are you getting at?

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:46.020
And really, saunas
and I do not get along.

00:09:46.020 --> 00:09:48.810
Whatever! Just help me out, okay?

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:03.540
Sanya-san?

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:05.830
What are you lookin' at, you glasses-wearing snob?

00:10:06.330 --> 00:10:09.580
Hey! Could you stop it with the insults?!

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:13.170
U-Um...

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:15.670
Are you sure about this?

00:10:16.090 --> 00:10:18.510
I'm sure. Please do it.

00:10:18.510 --> 00:10:20.090
B-But...

00:10:20.090 --> 00:10:24.310
Okay! Eila-san, pretend I'm Sanya-san and protect me.

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:27.230
Huh? Pretend you're Sanya?

00:10:27.230 --> 00:10:29.520
Are you... Are you
really sure about this?

00:10:29.520 --> 00:10:30.940
Just do it, already!

00:10:30.940 --> 00:10:32.190
O-Okay!

00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:39.950
A-Are you all right?

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:42.200
Why did you dodge it?!

00:10:42.200 --> 00:10:44.410
This training is pointless if you dodge it!

00:10:44.410 --> 00:10:48.500
Sorry. But you weren't
getting fully into it.

00:10:49.370 --> 00:10:53.000
Just who do you think I'm
putting my life on the line for?!

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:55.500
Lynne-san, just shoot, already!

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:57.050
B-But...

00:10:57.050 --> 00:10:58.090
I said, do it!

00:10:58.090 --> 00:10:59.380
O-Okay!

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:07.640
Wow... I can't do that.

00:11:07.640 --> 00:11:10.770
I never thought her skill would
actually put her at a disadvantage.

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:12.400
Eila-san!

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:14.690
How many times do I have to tell you?!

00:11:14.690 --> 00:11:17.690
I-I'm sorry!

00:11:24.410 --> 00:11:26.200
Huh? This is...

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:28.580
Your coat, isn't it?

00:11:29.410 --> 00:11:31.750
It's cold up in the stratosphere.

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:35.000
Oh, I see. It's been
forever since I've worn it.

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:36.880
So how did it go?

00:11:36.880 --> 00:11:37.420
Huh?

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:39.550
Perrine-san's training.

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:42.180
O-Oh? You knew?

00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:44.220
Did it go well?

00:11:46.560 --> 00:11:48.770
No. It went terribly.

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:50.730
I see.

00:11:53.690 --> 00:11:54.690
Huh?

00:11:54.690 --> 00:11:57.650
You're taking three scarves with you?

00:11:57.650 --> 00:11:59.190
Oh, these?

00:11:59.650 --> 00:12:02.450
These are for you, me, and Yoshika-chan.

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:04.280
Miyafuji?

00:12:04.280 --> 00:12:08.120
Yoshika-chan wasn't able to pack before coming here from Fuso,

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:10.120
so I figured I'd lend it to her.

00:12:10.580 --> 00:12:11.540
But...

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:16.040
I wish you were able to deploy shields, too.

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:17.040
Not gonna happen.

00:12:17.040 --> 00:12:17.710
Huh?

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:22.090
You can't force something you aren't used to doing.

00:12:23.180 --> 00:12:25.140
So you're giving up, Eila?

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:29.430
You can't do what you can't do, no matter how hard you try.

00:12:30.140 --> 00:12:32.640
You can't just say you
can't do it and give up!

00:12:34.270 --> 00:12:36.650
You just can't do it
because you've given up.

00:12:36.650 --> 00:12:40.320
Miyafuji could do it all along, so just let her protect you!

00:12:41.530 --> 00:12:42.990
You're so stupid, Eila!

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:44.280
And you're so stubborn, Sanya!

00:13:21.530 --> 00:13:25.650
Sanya!

00:13:28.370 --> 00:13:30.330
Ow!

00:13:31.790 --> 00:13:35.460
Oh, so you got into a fight.

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:38.130
It's nothing to laugh about.

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:42.460
So, what do you want to happen?

00:13:42.920 --> 00:13:43.960
Me?

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:46.090
I guess you have to obey orders.

00:14:59.870 --> 00:15:05.630
They said the Romagna fleet and air squadron engaged the Neuroi early this morning.

00:15:05.630 --> 00:15:06.380
The outcome?

00:15:07.550 --> 00:15:12.050
Both the <i>Zara </i>and <i>Pola </i>cruisers were defeated and sunk.

00:15:13.850 --> 00:15:15.890
Guess it's our turn.

00:15:20.020 --> 00:15:22.600
Looking good, Lucchini.

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:24.690
It's so hot in this...

00:15:24.690 --> 00:15:26.530
Bear with it, Lucchini.

00:15:26.530 --> 00:15:29.070
The stratosphere is super-cold.

00:15:29.070 --> 00:15:31.200
I hate the cold!

00:15:32.450 --> 00:15:35.030
Now put these on.

00:15:36.030 --> 00:15:37.330
So hot...

00:15:37.790 --> 00:15:41.040
Your coat is a little
big for me, Barkhorn-san.

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:42.710
Better than no coat.

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:43.630
Hmm?

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:46.590
What's all that?

00:15:46.590 --> 00:15:48.420
I decided to try making ginger tea.

00:15:49.010 --> 00:15:50.720
It's supposed to warm your body.

00:15:50.720 --> 00:15:52.550
Oh, I see.

00:15:54.760 --> 00:15:56.050
How is it?

00:15:56.050 --> 00:15:59.810
I used a lot of sugar,
so it should be easy to drink.

00:15:59.810 --> 00:16:01.690
You weren't kidding...

00:16:01.690 --> 00:16:04.230
Oh, but it's not as sweet as I expected-

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:06.860
I'll have another cup!

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:09.900
I-It takes a minute to kick in.

00:16:10.360 --> 00:16:13.610
If you just think of it as
medicine, it's not bad at all.

00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:17.370
<i>Why are you wearing Sanya's scarf?</i>

00:16:23.040 --> 00:16:24.000
Ten.

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:24.960
Nine.

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:25.960
Eight.

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:27.040
Seven.

00:16:27.040 --> 00:16:27.960
Six.

00:16:27.960 --> 00:16:28.800
Five.

00:16:29.050 --> 00:16:30.050
Four.

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:30.800
Three.

00:16:31.220 --> 00:16:31.800
Two.

00:16:32.090 --> 00:16:32.800
One.

00:16:40.100 --> 00:16:45.690
The mission will start with launch
group #1, five girls, with normal propulsion,

00:16:45.690 --> 00:16:47.560
to bring them up to ten thousand meters.

00:16:51.360 --> 00:16:55.780
Launch group #1 will detach, as they top out at ten thousand meters.

00:16:58.370 --> 00:17:01.830
They will then quickly ignite the rocket booster.

00:17:02.250 --> 00:17:06.420
Miyafuji and Sanya, the attacking group, will be lifted to twenty thousand meters.

00:17:12.050 --> 00:17:15.590
Then Miyafuji and Sanya
will light another booster.

00:17:16.220 --> 00:17:21.600
They will aim for 33 333 meters up, the location of the Neuroi's core.

00:17:22.390 --> 00:17:25.190
You are to fire directly toward the core.

00:17:25.560 --> 00:17:29.480
Altitude: thirty thousand meters.
Temperature: minus seventy degrees.

00:17:29.940 --> 00:17:34.530
No air... Without magic, you'd die in a second.

00:17:36.910 --> 00:17:39.160
There's no guarantee
you'll make it back alive.

00:17:41.030 --> 00:17:41.910
It's time!

00:18:02.060 --> 00:18:02.850
No!

00:18:03.390 --> 00:18:07.560
I'll... I'll protect Sanya!

00:18:10.480 --> 00:18:12.270
What are you doing, Eila?

00:18:12.270 --> 00:18:14.280
You said it yourself.

00:18:14.280 --> 00:18:16.400
That I couldn't do it because I gave up.

00:18:16.650 --> 00:18:19.530
I don't want to give up.

00:18:19.530 --> 00:18:23.080
I will protect you!

00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:28.000
Miyafuji.

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:30.540
Eila-san, let's go up together.

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:31.340
Huh?

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:39.510
Yoshika-chan!

00:18:39.510 --> 00:18:42.260
You mustn't! Your magic power won't last!

00:18:42.260 --> 00:18:44.260
You won't be able to make it back!

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:47.850
I will personally bring Eila back.

00:18:49.730 --> 00:18:51.770
I promise I will.

00:18:54.780 --> 00:18:57.150
Th-This is absurd.

00:18:57.150 --> 00:19:00.410
Go, Sanya! Eila!

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:19.220
<i>The train goes on and on, all the way to our future.</i>

00:19:19.220 --> 00:19:24.890
<i>Even if the emergency lights go out, the prism shows us the way.</i>

00:19:25.310 --> 00:19:31.520
<i>But the antenna is useless, so now we can't find the exit.</i>

00:19:31.520 --> 00:19:37.690
<i>The stillness of the night feels like it'll swallow us whole.</i>

00:19:38.190 --> 00:19:40.530
<i>Just softly grab on...</i>

00:19:40.530 --> 00:19:43.410
<i>To my shaky hand.</i>

00:19:44.200 --> 00:19:51.750
<i>I want us both to feel each
other's anxiety and courage.</i>

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:58.090
<i>I lend my harmony to your song.</i>

00:19:58.090 --> 00:20:04.140
<i>I'll guide you, not losing our way in the night.</i>

00:20:04.140 --> 00:20:10.390
<i>If we can stay calm for our
journey of thousands of miles...</i>

00:20:10.390 --> 00:20:20.610
<i>It will echo everywhere, our sweet duet.</i>

00:20:30.580 --> 00:20:36.630
<i>The tarot card that will tell me our destiny...</i>

00:20:36.630 --> 00:20:42.800
<i>Don't turn it over. I want it to stay a secret.</i>

00:20:42.800 --> 00:20:46.180
<i>When you've been hurt,</i>

00:20:46.180 --> 00:20:49.180
<i>lay here next to me.</i>

00:20:49.180 --> 00:20:57.150
<i>And when you fall asleep, you'll see</i>

00:20:57.150 --> 00:20:59.900
<i>us performing.</i>

00:21:03.530 --> 00:21:09.870
<i>Match your melody to the rhythm of my song.</i>

00:21:09.870 --> 00:21:15.580
<i>I want to lift the veil off the night.</i>

00:21:15.580 --> 00:21:22.090
<i>Together, we can forget all about the lonely times.</i>

00:21:22.090 --> 00:21:32.180
<i>We'll be together, forever, my dear.</i>

00:21:33.230 --> 00:21:34.600
Can you hear me?

00:21:34.600 --> 00:21:35.390
Yeah.

00:21:36.560 --> 00:21:37.810
I'm sorry.

00:21:38.730 --> 00:21:40.860
I'm sorry, too.

00:21:42.030 --> 00:21:45.320
Look, Eila. It's Orussia.

00:21:45.320 --> 00:21:46.740
Yeah.

00:21:47.740 --> 00:21:50.410
It's like you can reach out and touch the Ural Mountains.

00:21:51.120 --> 00:21:55.830
Can we fly over to the other side of the mountains like this?

00:21:58.250 --> 00:21:59.170
Sure.

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:04.170
I'd go to the end of the world with you.

00:22:06.300 --> 00:22:08.680
No. I'm sorry,

00:22:08.680 --> 00:22:13.220
but we have to return.

00:22:15.140 --> 00:22:21.150
I think I'm beginning to understand why she wants to protect people so much.

00:24:12.220 --> 00:24:13.840
This is an emergency announcement.

00:24:13.840 --> 00:24:16.010
Something has infiltrated the base.

00:24:16.300 --> 00:24:19.220
Ladies, begin emergency procedures.

00:24:19.350 --> 00:24:21.640
Next time on <i>Strike Witches 2:</i>
